{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1000_p", "source_sha256": "01f8c4c32ce9c6d6bcd187a1ec733450fd909137a73e5a93873d0c3eecaf8bb0", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画の一環で、真はぬいぐるみ用の\nコスチュームをイベントでPRすることになった）", "zh": "（作为角色扮演写真企划的一环，真要在活动上为毛绒玩偶服装进行宣传）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "6149a73f57d87f3230b219bdad6468a6bde68781b5e9fedff169dea781a6283c", "ja": "はあ～……このコーデ、カワイイなぁ。でも、これには\nこっちの小物も合うし……？　うう、悩む～～～！", "zh": "唉～……这套搭配好可爱啊。不过，这个小配饰也很适合它……？呜呜，好纠结啊～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d9383c5e260556edabe41b250990dc9336f7e414b0a586d745267f698f22bd01", "ja": "どうしたんだ、真？\n廊下にまで声が聞こえてきたけど……。", "zh": "怎么了，真？\n在走廊都听到你的声音了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "e88faf8b0643dca14c591297c301ce0388c10248b53c6cd5b0b7daaab19d4784", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　助けてください！\nボク、好きなコが多すぎて、一番が決められません～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！请帮帮我！我喜欢的孩子太多了，实在选不出最喜欢的那个～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1004_p", "source_sha256": "94794fc73e9528be26b648f37f7639bfeb5e05bb34ae3eee4d99f6fe022da71f", "ja": "誤解を招く言い方！　……えーと、ぬいぐるみの\nコーディネートを考えて、紹介するんだったな。", "zh": "这说法很容易让人误会！……呃，我们是要考虑玩偶的搭配，然后向大家介绍来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "a6c3702d283531ec4e2f0519af7e1c15a4366b4a2ea553352c59c833798f1578", "ja": "そうなんです。スタッフさんが、キツネのぬいぐるみと\n一緒に、服や小物を持ってきてくれたんです。", "zh": "是这样的。工作人员带来了狐狸玩偶，还有搭配的服装和小饰品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "e77bafff5e6e124559ef15e0319637b483e549f2732c55662dfef646d023a150", "ja": "たくさん用意してくれたのは、ありがたいんですけど。\nどれもカワイすぎて……ひとつに絞れません～～っ！", "zh": "准备了这么多，真是太感谢了。可是每一件都可爱过头了……我没法只选一个～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "134b74daf465818d8fec3ec081c5f9827f4a2cae7a21bec61d193f5478ffd044", "ja": "すごく贅沢な悩みだってわかってますけど……\nうわあ～！　ボクはどうしたらいいんだぁ～！", "zh": "我知道这真是个奢侈的烦恼，可是……呜哇～！我该怎么办才好啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_1008", "source_sha256": "fcf0fd4a5756fd9b4646919876d725ff39ce5a656fcab1bd3a4db51f9226f22a", "ja": "全部で！", "zh": "全部！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0d41d103ab3e6781a8609efb99a6d4c9267f0f8334e2000b8f32eeb11f84563b", "ja": "悩むくらいなら、全部紹介しちゃおう！　とりあえず\nぬいぐるみには、一番のお気に入りを着せて……。", "zh": "既然这么为难，不如全部介绍吧！总之，先给玩偶穿上最喜欢的那套……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2001_p", "source_sha256": "c129f8198eedc393b40fb2e5c7648f2ee417176129afc32bc34b6d5aeb272478", "ja": "他のコーディネートも写真に撮って、イベントの時に\n映してもらうんだ。それなら気もすむだろ？", "zh": "把其他搭配也拍成照片，活动时让他们放出来。这样你就满意了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2002_006mak", "source_sha256": "9ce506f093935df609b059ebf89e7eeb2f3b1457ae449bfffeca420edd655d14", "ja": "{$P$}、頭イイ～♪　そうすれば\n平等ですよね。今すぐやりましょう！", "zh": "{$P$}，真聪明～♪ 这样就公平了吧。现在马上开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2003_006mak", "source_sha256": "010ee2b025d9b9c269b536b77167e897d918f47f89ea6532fd53cdc2a3d0b3dc", "ja": "えへへ。今から素敵な姿にしてあげるから、\nちょっとだけ待っててね。とりあえず……っと。", "zh": "嘿嘿。现在就把你打扮成漂亮的样子，稍微等我一下哦。先从……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2004_null", "source_sha256": "f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3", "ja": "10分後……", "zh": "10分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2005_006mak", "source_sha256": "c334fad3226e492093c858fb32c2388855cb35f6791fff47ada320ee615e25a0", "ja": "あああ～！　大変です、{$P$}！\nボクの愛が爆発しちゃって……うわ～ん！", "zh": "啊啊啊～！不得了了，{$P$}！\n我的爱要爆炸了……呜哇～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2006_p", "source_sha256": "fcb51c572ce0b1301cae7605d03c20063a6c597c6d651cb0dd33e272103d95d3", "ja": "えっ？　今度は一体、何が？", "zh": "诶？这次到底又怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2007_006mak", "source_sha256": "f0574a6e7f78d1840b9c7a711cb0b075672cfa3e394460f34bef35095ba4d518", "ja": "「とりあえず一番」なんて決められないんですよ～！\nどうしましょう、{$P$}！", "zh": "“总之先定一个第一名”这种事，我可决定不了呀～！\n怎么办，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0523_2008_p", "source_sha256": "50745c1b4da0bcca74d50c75afa79ddf630420682af6f62bd6bd149d6cfb1eb2", "ja": "（結局、ぬいぐるみもたくさん用意してもらって\nいろんなコーデを紹介できた。よかったな……真）", "zh": "（结果，还请他们准备了好多毛绒玩偶，得以介绍各种搭配。太好了……真。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
